/*
 * Windows 10/11 compatibility manifest.
 *
 * Without it Windows treats the app as pre-Win7: no DPI awareness (the UI is
 * bitmap-stretched and blurry), no long-path support, and the version APIs
 * report faked values.
 *
 * Paths and version are injected by CMake so they cannot drift from the build.
 *
 * This file is compiled into the executable only for MinGW/Clang toolchains.
 * MSVC's linker generates and embeds its own manifest (resource id 1), so
 * embedding a second copy here would fail with CVT1100 "duplicate resource"
 * followed by LNK1123. For MSVC the manifest is handed to the linker instead
 * (see /MANIFESTINPUT in CMakeLists.txt).
 */
1 24 "@IMAGEPRO_MANIFEST@"
